<template><ToolShell :eyebrow="label('Migration planner', 'Planificador de migración')" :title="label('Create a safer migration outline', 'Crea un plan de migración más seguro')" :description="label('Inventory the current environment and receive a no-side-effect sequence for validation and cutover.', 'Inventaría el entorno actual y recibe una secuencia sin efectos para validación y cambio.')"><form class="stack" @submit.prevent="run"><div class="form-grid"><BaseInput id="migration-provider" v-model="values.current_provider" name="current_provider" :label="label('Current provider', 'Proveedor actual')" /><BaseInput id="migration-domains" v-model="values.domains" name="domains" type="number" :label="label('Sending domains', 'Dominios de envío')" /><BaseInput id="migration-templates" v-model="values.templates" name="templates" type="number" :label="label('Templates', 'Plantillas')" /><BaseCheckbox v-model="values.suppressions_available" name="suppressions_available">{{ label('Suppression data is available', 'Los datos de supresión están disponibles') }}</BaseCheckbox></div><BaseButton type="submit" :disabled="pending">{{ label('Build plan', 'Crear plan') }}</BaseButton><BaseAlert v-if="errorMessage" tone="danger">{{ errorMessage }}</BaseAlert><div v-if="result" class="stack"><ol class="plan"><li v-for="phase in result.phases" :key="phase.id"><strong>{{ phase.id }}</strong><span>{{ phase.title }}</span></li></ol><BaseAlert v-for="risk in result.risks" :key="risk" tone="warning">{{ risk }}</BaseAlert></div></form></ToolShell></template>
<script setup lang="ts">interface Result{phases:{id:string;title:string}[];risks:string[]}const{locale}=useLocale();const label=(en:string,es:string)=>locale.value==='es'?es:en;const values=reactive({current_provider:'',domains:'',templates:'',suppressions_available:false});const result=ref<Result>();const{pending,errorMessage,execute}=useToolRequest();const run=async()=>{result.value=await execute<Result>('/api/v1/tools/migration-plan',{...values})}</script>
<style scoped>.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.plan{display:grid;gap:.8rem;padding:0;list-style:none}.plan li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:8rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);border-radius:var(--radius-md)}@media(max-width:36rem){.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.plan li{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
